{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 29, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a plan for Japan a journey grand\nA tapestry of sights across the land.\n\n**Day First Tokyo's Bright Embrace**\n\nArrive at Narita's gate a weary soul\nThen whisk to Shinjuku a bustling whole.\nLodgings secured a haven sweet and deep\nWhere slumber waits and weary spirits sleep.\nExplore Shinjuku Gyoen a garden fair\nA tranquil space beyond all worldly care.\nDinner awaits in Golden Gai's dim light\nA thousand tales unfold throughout the night.\n\n**Day Second Tokyo's Wonders Unfold**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple we shall haste\nSensoji's grandeur cannot be replaced.\nNakamise-dori a market bright\nWith trinkets treats and visions pure and white.\nThen Shibuya's crossing a human tide\nA spectacle of movement far and wide.\nHarajuku's fashions bold and free\nA vibrant pulse for all the world to see.\n\n**Day Third Hakone's Mountainous Grace**\n\nFrom Tokyo's sprawl to Hakone we flee\nWhere Mount Fuji reigns for all to see.\nA cruise upon Lake Ashi a gentle sway\nReflecting peaks in hues of silver gray.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum a sight\nWith sculptures grand bathed in morning light.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm\nTo ease the body and to keep it calm.\n\n**Day Fourth Kyoto Ancient Charm**\n\nThe bullet train awaits a swift desire\nTo Kyoto's heart a land of ancient fire.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion dream\nA thousand torii a sacred gleam.\nGion's district where geishas softly tread\nA glimpse of beauty silently spread.\nA traditional dinner a feast divine\nWith artistry and flavors truly fine.\n\n**Day Fifth Kyoto's Temples Old**\n\nKiyomizu-dera's stage a wondrous view\nOf Kyoto's sprawl a panorama true.\nKinkaku-ji's gold a shining grace\nA temple mirrored in a watery space.\nRyoan-ji's garden stones a mystic art\nA contemplation held within the heart.\nNijo Castle's halls a history told\nOf shoguns past and stories brave and bold.\n\n**Day Sixth Nara's Deer and Temples Deep**\n\nTo Nara we journey where deer roam free\nA sacred park for all the world to see.\nTodai-ji Temple houses Buddha grand\nA monument of faith throughout the land.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns softly glow\nA pathway lit where ancient spirits flow.\nReturn to Kyoto's embrace once more\nTo gather thoughts and memories to store.\n\n**Day Seventh Farewell Japan**\n\nA final breakfast a bittersweet goodbye\nTo Japan's beauty beneath the azure sky.\nDepart from Kansai's airport with a tear\nA promise made to return next year.\nOf temples gardens mountains seas so blue\nJapan's enchantment forever fresh and new.\nSo ends this voyage a tale well spun\nUntil we meet again beneath the sun.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.012519695796072483}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.48004651069641113}, {"token": "▁plan", "logprob": -1.6618263721466064}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.0019407500512897968}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.05671196058392525}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.013660400174558163}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.27131426334381104}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.04722566530108452}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0006824786541983485}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.17420396208763123}, {"token": "▁tapestry", "logprob": -1.5771253108978271}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.005944785661995411}, {"token": "▁sights", "logprob": -0.7775366902351379}, {"token": "▁across", "logprob": -0.1675591617822647}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.00023541064001619816}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -1.7881377516459906e-06}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.15203626453876495}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0007883778307586908}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.013621358200907707}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.007384504657238722}, {"token": "▁First", "logprob": -1.8525958061218262}, {"token": "▁Tokyo", "logprob": -0.24901625514030457}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.02106274478137